{
  "description": "Golden set for URL recipe import (WS02). 50 public recipe pages across 25 domains. `expect` holds the title, ingredient count (the eval allows +/-1), and minimum step count. `expectPath` is the stage that should read the page: jsonld (schema.org data) or llm (no structured data, so the Sonnet fallback reads the page text). A llm case must name an open `license`: its page text is kept as a fixture, and only openly licensed text may be (see README, Fixtures and licensing). `recorder: deno` marks a site that refuses Node's fetch; record-deno.ts records it. `blocked` is for a site that refuses every client and counts as a failure.",
